{
  "comment": [
    "Where every skill in this bundle installs. CTC-2558.",
    "These skills are a person's own tools, not a repository's: they install to the home scope",
    "(npx skills … -g) and never into a project directory. A skill in skills/ that is not listed",
    "here fails `bun run test:guards`; add it rather than letting it ship unowned.",
    "Hand-maintained on purpose — there is no --write mode, because a generated entry would mean",
    "a new skill could never be caught as unowned."
  ],
  "version": 1,
  "scopes": {
    "home": "Under the person's $HOME: ~/.claude/skills, ~/.agents/skills and the other agent roots the CLI writes with -g.",
    "repository": "Inside a project directory: <repo>/.claude/skills, <repo>/.agents/skills, <repo>/agent/skills and <repo>/skills-lock.json. Not shipped by this bundle."
  },
